{"seq":2,"slug":"mental-models-movement","title":"思维模型的传播","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/influence-and-legacy/mental-models-movement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"popularizing-mental-models","title":"思维模型的普及","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/influence-and-legacy/mental-models-movement/popularizing-mental-models","wordCount":1545,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-beyond-finance","title":"超越金融的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/influence-and-legacy/mental-models-movement/influence-beyond-finance","wordCount":1634,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"思维模型的传播\">思维模型的传播</h1><p>本章阐述查理·芒格&quot;多元思维模型&quot;理念所引发的广泛思想浪潮。经过《穷查理宝典》等著作的传播，&quot;思维模型&quot;从芒格的演讲走向了大众的视野，引发了一场深刻的思维方式革新。更可贵的是，芒格的影响早已超越金融，延伸到商业管理、教育学习、决策认知等广阔的领域。本章呈现的，是芒格思想强大的传播力与普世价值——它启迪了一代又一代追求理性与智慧的求知者。</p>\n"}